- Good day to you, my father the king,<br>
- Good day to you my son in God<br> 
<br>
- What punishment is due<br> 
To a wife in a badly matched couple? <br>
- If her husband is a honest man<br>
She must be sentenced severely.<br>
<br> 
Sentenced to the sword or the stake<br>
Or the gallows, to some swift death.<br> 
- Thanks God: T'was on your daughter<br> 
Hénori  that you passed the sentence!<br>
